# Session sheet (overrides `session-console.mdc` and `design.md` where they conflict)

Plan and phases: `.cursor/scopes/session-sheet/PLAN.md`. Ship phases in order. Each phase PR updates the docs it changes.

## Locked (owner decisions 2026-11-12 — do not re-litigate)

| Topic | Verdict |
| :--- | :--- |
| Week rail | Session screen shows the other days of the **same assigned Block + Week**. An unlabeled session inside a labeled week's date span is shown there, tagged `no Week`, with `Assign to Week N`. **Never auto-write labels.** In no span → `Assign a Week` hint. In two spans → nearest week. |
| Rail rows | One line per lift: name + scheme. Same list layout in every mode (Plan, Log, Both). Never a comma-joined line. Lift names high contrast. |
| Session header | **Day** (`Day N`) is the large line. Name is optional and appears as a small muted subtitle. Date · Week · Block · set count are muted meta. Replaces session-console "Name is the only large line". |
| Session/day summary | **Set count only** (and `Logged x / y sets` in Both). No session or day tonnage, NL, or average intensity. |
| Lift summary | NL · Volume · Int per lift. |
| Grouping | Merge consecutive plan sets only when reps, intensity, `dropPercent` **and kg** are equal. Different kg: never merge. Label `3 sets`, with faint numbers `2–4`; a single set shows its number only. Display layer only: one record per set stays. |
| Fewer sets than logged | Set leaves Plan; its log stays as a `scope: 'log'` row. Never delete a log. |
| Ghost targets | Empty Log cells show the Plan target faintly. Plain Enter does **not** fill. **Ctrl/Cmd+Enter** accepts (copies Plan to that set). |
| Variation | `LiftVariationPicker` modifiers (Bar / Tempo / ROM / Gear). Never a fixed short list. |
| Lift menu | `⋯`: Duplicate, Swap lift…, Add note, Delete. Shown on the hovered/focused row only. |
| Columns kept | `%` (dropPercent) and INOL stay, even though the mockups omit them. Δ stays as defined until the Δ rethink. |
| Copy | UI copy is **English**. Translation later. |

## Non-goals

Week board (variant B). Changing Δ math. Russian UI strings. Auto-assigning Block/Week. A grid library.
